Z||000003||Archie||01-24-2001||04:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pherder:<BR><B>A moment of silence ... please.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm so insensitive, I didn't realize how hurtful those pictures might be to others.<P>You need to know that that '88 Formula's demise was a revival for several other Fieros.<P>For example the full suspension, engine cradle, transaxle etc. are in the Dom. Republic right now. The Doors are in my posession right now, about to be remounted on a '87 GT chassis that was parted out by someone else last year. The windshield was removed to be put into my next Chop Top car. The decklid also has been used to help save another life.<P>Be assured that this demise is not without merit, it will go in peace and is accompanied by 3 used up 4 cylinder Fiero engines, 3 wasted 125 transmissions and 2 "Holed" 2.8 engines.<P>Archie<BR>||||reg||1
